# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository.
#
# Without this, committing from Windows stores CRLF, and the first clone on a
# Mac or a Linux box shows every one of the 54 files as entirely rewritten --
# which makes the history useless for exactly the review the honesty checks
# exist to support. Perl, node-less JS and CSS are all happy with LF on
# Windows, so there is nothing to trade away here.
* text=auto eol=lf
